LoadLib - Sample DLL for both Win16 and Win32
=============================================================================

The files in this directory are the source code to a C language DLL that
can be compiled for either Win16 or Win32, and a test program written in
MapBasic that exercises the function in the DLL.

Files in this directory are:

     READ.ME            - this file

     LIBMAIN.H          - source file header
     LOADLIB.C          - main C language source file

     LOADLIB.MB         - MapBasic source file for test program

     LOADLIB.MAK        - Visual C++ v1.5 makefile (Win16)
     LOADLIB.DEF        - Module Definition file required by VC++ v1.5

     LOADLB32.MAK       - Visual C++ v2.2 makefile (Win32)

     LOADLIB.MBX        - compiled MapBasic application
     LOADLIB.DLL        - compiled Win16 DLL
     LOADLB32.DLL       - compiled Win32 DLL

